# Local data / caches (PIT cache, backups) — never source of truth.
# Leading slash anchors these to the repo root: an unanchored `data/` also matched the
# `icarus/agents/data` source package and silently kept task 1.1 out of the repo.
/data/
*.sqlite
*.db
/backups/

